From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wintab32: manager handles, context enumeration, config replacement, save/restore (3546)

wintab32: manager handles, context enumeration, config replacement, save/restore

WTMgrOpen/WTMgrClose keep manager handles that receive the context open, close, update and overlap messages at their own
message base. WTMgrContextEnum, WTMgrContextOwner, WTMgrDefContext(Ex) (driver default contexts, opened disabled),
WTMgrConfigReplaceEx A/W installs the procedure WTConfig calls. WTSave/WTRestore store and reopen the logical context.
WTExtGet/WTExtSet/WTMgrExt/WTMgrCsrExt answer FALSE: the driver has no extensions.
---
--- a/dlls/wintab32/context.c
+++ b/dlls/wintab32/context.c
